#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid "&filelight; 1.20 Screenshot"
msgstr "&filelight; 1.20 Snimak ekrana"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:50 index.docbook:69 index.docbook:86 index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&filelight; allows you to quickly understand exactly where your diskspace is "
"being used by graphically representing your file system as a set of "
"concentric segmented-rings. You can use it to locate hotspots of disk usage "
"and then manipulate those areas using &konqueror;."
msgstr ""
"&filelight; vam omogućava da brzo shvatite gdje se vaš disk prostor koristi "
"grafičkim predstavljanjem sistema kao skupa koncentričnih segmentiranih-"
"prstenova. Možete ga koristiti za lociranje žarišta korištenja diska a zatim "
"manipulirati tim područjima upotrebom &konqueror;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &filelight;"
msgstr "Podešavanje &filelight;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The &filelight; settings dialog has two tabs for configuring the &filelight; "
"options. The two tabs are <guilabel>Scanning</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Appearance</guilabel>. Below is a description of the settings "
"tabs. The &filelight; settings dialog can be found by clicking "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure Filelight</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"The &filelight; dijalog postavki ima dva taba za konfiguraciju &filelight; "
"opcija. Ta dva taba su <guilabel>Skeniranje</guilabel> and <guilabel>Izgled</"
"guilabel>. Ispod je opis taba za postavke. &filelight; dijalog postavki može "
"se naći klikom na <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfiguriši Filelight</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanning"
msgstr "Skeniranje"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanning Screenshot"
msgstr "Skeniranje snimka ekrana"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The scanning tab allows you to configure how &filelight; scans folders. The "
"<guilabel> Do not scan these folders</guilabel> is used to exclude certain "
"folders from your scan. This option is very useful for skipping folders that "
"you may not have permissions to read, or folders that are part of a virtual "
"filesystem, such as /proc. To add a folder to the list, click the "
"<guibutton>Add...</guibutton> button, this will start a dialog where you can "
"choose the folder of your choice from a tree view. To remove a folder simply "
"select the folder of your choice and click the <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> "
"button."
msgstr ""
"Tab skeniranja vam omogućava da konfigurišete kako &filelight; skenira "
"foldere. <guilabel> Ne skeniraj ove foldere</guilabel>se koristi da isključi "
"određene foldere iz vašeg skeniranja. Ova opcija je vrlo korisna za "
"preskakanje foldera za koje možda nemate dozvolu za čitanje, ili foldere "
"koje su dio virtualnog datotečnog sistema, kao što je /proc. Da biste dodali "
"folder na listu, kliknite na <guibutton>Dodaj...</guibutton> dugme, ovo će "
"započeti dijalog u kojem možete odabrati folder po vašem izboru iz prikaza "
"stabla foldera. Da biste uklonili folder jednostavno izaberite folder po "
"vašem izboru i kliknite na <guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton> dugme."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using <guilabel>Scan across filesystem boundaries</guilabel> allows scans to "
"enter folders that are part of other filesystems. For example, when "
"unchecked, this will usually prevent the contents of <filename class="
"\"directory\">/mnt</filename> from being scanned if you scan starting from "
"the root folder <filename class=\"directory\">/</filename>. A scan of remote "
"filesystems, &eg; NFS or Samba mounts, can generate high network traffic. To "
"prevent scanning them check <guilabel>Exclude remote filesystems</guilabel>. "
"The next option <guilabel>Exclude removable media</guilabel> prevents "
"&filelight; from scanning removable media (&eg; &CD-ROM;s)."
msgstr ""
"Upotreba <guilabel>Skeniraj preko granica datotečnog sistema</guilabel> "
"omogućava skeniranju ulazak u foldere koje su dio drugih datotečnih sistema. "
"Na primjer, kada nije označeno, to će obično spriječiti skeniranje sadržaja "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/mnt</filename> ako skenirate počevši od root "
"folder <filename class=\"directory\">/</filename>. Skeniranje udaljenih "
"datotečnih sistema, &eg; NFS ili Samba mount-i, može rezultirati visokim "
"mrežnim prometom. Da biste spriječili njihovo skeniranje "
"označite<guilabel>Isključi udaljene datotečne sisteme</guilabel>. Sljedeća "
"opcija <guilabel>Isključi prijenosne medije</guilabel> spriječava "
"&filelight; da skenira prijenosne medije (&eg; &CD-ROM;ove)."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Izgled"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "Appearance Screenshot"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana izgleda"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Appearance</guilabel> tab allows you to configure the way "
"&filelight; looks."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Izgled</guilabel> kartica vam dozvoljava da konfigurišete kako "
"&filelight; izgleda."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Color scheme</guilabel> section is used to choose a color "
"scheme for &filelight;. The color schemes are <guilabel>Rainbow</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>System Colors</guilabel>, and <guilabel>High Contrast</guilabel>. "
"There is also a <guilabel>Contrast</guilabel> slider to adjust the contrast "
"of the ring segments for easier viewing."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Šema boja</guilabel> sekcija se koristi za odabir kombinacije boja "
"za &filelight;. Šeme boja su <guilabel>Duga</guilabel>, <guilabel>Sistemske "
"boje</guilabel>, i <guilabel>Visoki kontrast</guilabel>. Tu je i  "
"<guilabel>Kontrast</guilabel> klizač za podešavanje kontrasta prstenovih "
"segmenata za lakše gledanje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Use anti-aliasing</guilabel> check box is used to enable the "
"use of anti-aliasing in the &filelight; view. Selected, this option makes "
"the ring segments have a much cleaner look."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Koristi anti-aliasing</guilabel> se koristi kako bi se omogućilo "
"korištenje anti-aliasinga u &filelight;u. Ukoliko je odabrana, ova opcija "
"čini da segmenti prstena imaju mnogo čistiji izgled."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:93
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Vary label font sizes</guilabel> check box is useful when you "
"have files or folders with long names. This option will change the size of "
"the font to allow it to fit in the view better. When this option is enabled "
"a <guilabel>Minimum font size</guilabel> spinbox becomes available for "
"choosing the smallest size font to scale to."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Odstupanja oznake veličine fontova</guilabel> kućica je korisna "
"kada imate datoteke ili foldere s dugim imenima. Ova opcija će promijeniti "
"veličinu fonta kako bi se bolje uklopio u prikaz. Kada je ova opcija "
"uključena <guilabel> Minimalna veličina fonta</guilabel> rotirajuća kutija "
"postaje dostupna za odabir najmanju veličine slova za skaliranje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Show small files</guilabel> option is disabled by default as "
"small files tend to clutter the &filelight; view. Enable this option if you "
"would like to have your small files included in the &filelight; view. These "
"files are merged all into a single <quote>multi-segment</quote>."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel> Prikaži male datoteke</guilabel> opcija je isključena pri "
"početnim postavkama jer male datoteke imaju tendenciju da zatrpaju  "
"&filelight; pregled. Omogućite ovu opciju ako želite da se vaše male "
"datoteke budu uključene u &filelight; pregledu. Ove datoteke se spajaju u "
"jedan <quote>multi segmentirani</quote>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &filelight;"
msgstr "Upotreba &filelight;a"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting &filelight;"
msgstr "Započinjanje &filelight;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid "&filelight; can be started from the K-Menu, or from the command-line"
msgstr "&filelight; može se pokrenuti iz K-Menija, ili iz komandne linije"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "From the K-Menu"
msgstr "Iz K-Menija"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the &kde; program menu by clicking on the <guiicon>big K</guiicon> icon "
"on your panel. This will raise the <guimenu>program menu</guimenu>. Move "
"your cursor up the menu to the <guimenu>Utilities</guimenu> menu item. "
"Choose <guimenuitem>&filelight;</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite &kde; programski meni klikom na <guiicon>veliko K</guiicon>. To će "
"podići <guimenu>programski meni </guimenu>. Pomaknite kursor na "
"<guimenu>Dodaci</guimenu> stavku menija. Odaberite <guimenuitem>&filelight; "
"</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "From the Command Line"
msgstr "Iz komandne linije"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can start &filelight; by typing its name on the command line. If you "
"give it a folder name, as in the example below, it will scan that folder."
msgstr ""
"Možete pokrenuti &filelight; upisivanjem njegovog imena na komandnoj liniji. "
"Ako mu date ime foldera, kao u primjeru ispod, skenirat će taj folder."

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput><command>filelight</command> "
"<option><replaceable>/home</replaceable></option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>%</prompt><userinput><command>filelight</command> "
"<option><replaceable>/home</replaceable></option></userinput>"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanning folders"
msgstr "Skeniranje foldera"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scanning a folder shows it's contents as a filemap. To scan a folder, use "
"the scan menu, or type a &URL; straight into the location bar."
msgstr ""
"Skeniranje foldera pokazuje njegov sadržaj kao kartu datoteka. Da skeniratee "
"folder, koristite meni skeniranje, ili pišite &URL; direktno u lokacijski "
"bar."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exploring Filemaps"
msgstr "Istraživanje karte datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Once a scan has completed you will be presented with a filemap that "
"represents the folder you scanned. The filemap is a series of segmented-"
"rings that expand from the center. Brightly colored segments are folders, "
"gray segments are files. Segments are sized in proportion to their filesize. "
"Segments can be nested, so for example, <filename class=\"directory\">/home/"
"mxcl</filename> will be one level outwards and within the bounds of the "
"segment representing <filename class=\"directory\">/home</filename>. "
"Segments are labeled and hovering the mouse over segments will give you more "
"details of that segment and its child segments."
msgstr ""
"Kada skeniranje završi bit će vam predstavljena karta datoteka koja "
"predstavlja folder koji ste skenirali. Karta datoteka je serija "
"segmentiranih-prstenova koji se šire od centra. Segmenti svijetlih boja su "
"folderi, dok su segmenti sive boje datoteke. Segmenti su veliki "
"proporcionalno veličini fajla. Segmenti mogu biti ugniježdeni, tako na "
"primjer, <filename class=\"direktorij\">/home/mxcl</filename> će biti jedan "
"nivo prema van i unutar granica segmenta koji predstavlja <filename class="
"\"direktorij\">/home</filename>. Segmenti su označeni i prelaskom miša preko "
"segmenta će vam dati više detalja o tom segmentu i njegovim podsegmentima."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filemap Screenshot"
msgstr "Snimak ekrana karte datoteka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:151
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can open folders with your default file manager or &konsole; using the "
"context menu for that segment. A &MMB; click opens files by mimetype, &eg; "
"images with <application>Gwenview</application>. You can right click a "
"segment to get a context menu for the scanned folder with actions to copy "
"the folder path to the clipboard or delete the folder or file. Left clicking "
"segments will re-center the map on that segment."
msgstr ""
"Možete otvoriti foldere sa svojim menadžerom za datoteke ili &konsole; "
"koristeći kontekst meni za taj segment. &MMB; klik otvara datoteke za "
"mimetype, &eg; slike sa <application>Gwenview</application>. Možete kliknuti "
"desni klik na segment da dobijete kontekstualni meni za skenirani folder sa "
"akcijama da kopirate put do folder u ostavu ili da obrišete folder ili "
"datoteku. Lijevi klik na segmenti će reorganizovati kartu sa centarom na tom "
"segmentu."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu and Command Reference"
msgstr "Meni i naredbe"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Scan Menu"
msgstr "Meni za skeniranje"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Scan</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Scan folder..</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Skeniranje</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Skeniraj folder..</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Offers a folder selection dialog so you can choose a folder to scan."
msgstr ""
"Nudi dijalog za izbor foldera tako da možete odabrati folder za skeniranje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keysym>Home</keysym></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Scan</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Scan Home folder</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keysym>Home</keysym></keycombo> "
"</shortcut> <guimenu>Scan</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Skeniraj home folder</"
"guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:180
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starts a scan of the user's home folder."
msgstr "Pokreće skeniranje korisnikovog home foldera."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Scan</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Scan Root folder</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Skeniraj</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Skeniraj root folder</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:188
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starts a scan of the root folder."
msgstr "Pokreće skeniranje root foldera."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:201
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>F5</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>Scan</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Rescan</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>F5</keycap> </shortcut> <guimenu>Skeniraj</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Ponovo skeniraj</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:208
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starts a new scan of the current working folder, this is useful when changes "
"have been made to the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Započinje novo skeniranje trenutnog radnog foldera, ovo je korisno kada su "
"napravljene promjene u datotečnom sistemu."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:212
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> &Esc; </shortcut> <guimenu>Scan</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Stop</"
"guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> &Esc; </shortcut> <guimenu>Skeniraj</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Zaustavi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:219
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stops the current scan."
msgstr "Zaustavlja trenutno skeniranje."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Scan</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Skeniraj</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Izađi</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:230
#, no-c-format
msgid "Quits &filelight;."
msgstr "Prekida &filelight;."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "The View Menu"
msgstr "Meni pregled"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:238
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>+</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom In</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>+</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Uvećaj</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:245
#, no-c-format
msgid "Increase the view of the filemap."
msgstr "Uvećava pregled karte datoteka."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:250
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>-</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>View</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Zoom Out</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>-</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Pregled</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Umanji</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid "Decrease the view of the filemap."
msgstr "Umanjava pregled karte datoteka."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Go Menu"
msgstr "Meni idi"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:265
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>Up</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Go</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Up</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Alt;<keycap>Up</keycap></keycombo> </"
"shortcut> <guimenu>Idi</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Gore</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: action
#: index.docbook:272
#, no-c-format
msgid "Moves you up one step in the filesystem to the parent folder."
